TITLE:: SDGSyncWindow
summary:: the window of an SDGSync: long samples on one tempo and in one key, and the Tidal code
categories:: Libraries>SuperDirtGUI
related:: Classes/SDGSync, Classes/SDGWindow

DESCRIPTION::
Shows an link::Classes/SDGSync::: the tempo, the key, the chop, a row for each sample with what
happens to it, and the Tidal code, to copy or to hear first with strong::play::. Everything is
worked out again when a setting, a sample or the analysis changes.

code::
~sdg.sync.gui;
::

In the control window's sound explorer, strong::sync...:: opens it, and code::y:: or strong::add to
sync:: in the right-click menu adds the selected sample, or every sample of a selected bank. In the
list, delete removes a sample; space plays and stops.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
ARGUMENT:: sync
an link::Classes/SDGSync::. Use link::Classes/SDGSync#-gui::.

METHOD:: windowBounds
Where the next window opens: where the last one closed.

METHOD:: keyChoices
RETURNS:: the keys of the key menu after auto: twelve major, then twelve minor.

METHOD:: chopLabels
RETURNS:: the chop menu's items.

